w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oVWgksCESegQ7kNvwFhzkMe&_nc_oc=Adl7t0HMQbGssXXEPrmYXy7tA3sJKddkHZx_wRrbh1W26kQFI0P7v22V06UdjYrkqtc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzT5p3JI1ukBckmh2oDuxqVxD6-aPNxGGwUqBjamdHexg&oe=69B3FBAA"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zNovIK4rko0Q7kNvwEufSaF&_nc_oc=Adlquzlf1Nf9Mw6JNHfPpeYNmmzjHa04USwqV3zTWDVV84R23R7_FiKky_7pNKxve90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw4EOEbLLRFSFnExtKOmp8hTGy2AOTOIoNeAdmFukmcXw&oe=69B40E5E"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qSeY1vXyjPoQ7kNvwE0wDl3&_nc_oc=AdkjrLs00RJTQQwHwqn9jNAda-9jvOaRf4bbOjl79TIZBLWUpiKmzpqYYNDp73VnZd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw7Nvce48DxzuvrihquKRvzgYZdlXp8cAX_wDlMKBp-PA&oe=69B3FD31"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9